WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.530
If there's a monster that roars, I'll beat it to a pulp!

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.580
If there's a shining treasure, I'll force myself to keep it to myself!

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.430
I'll be bold, powerful, and change!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.760
Victory is for me!

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.800
Even if I'm blown away by the wind,

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.260
If I can catch even a single spell,

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:28.500
I'm jealous of my Petalmon!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.760
This power

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.420
I'll give you the treasure you've been waiting for!

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:10.580
I can't stop you!

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:43.350
Wow! He's so brave! He's a magical otaku!

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:44.110
The

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.270
With the help of genius magician Rina Inverse,

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.960
the evil band of bandits will be destroyed.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.830
One evil will be destroyed.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:11.070
However, as long as there is evil in this world,

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.800
Rina's battle will not end.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.600
Do your best, Rina!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.020
Don't lose, Rina!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.810
I... I...

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:22.690
I... I...

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:27.720
Rina, the slave of anger!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:38.400
I was being chased.

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.960
I just gave them a little treasure,

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.300
but they kept chasing me.

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:47.810
It looks like they're surrounded.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:56.700
We finally caught up, young lady.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.440
How dare you make us your slaves!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.620
Ah!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.550
That's a bad line.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.840
You know what, old man?

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.830
I'm going to make sure you get this.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:13.770
To be honest, I don't want to fight you.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.220
W-w-w-wait a minute!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.820
Anyway, if we do it properly,

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.600
I'm going to be in a lot of pain.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.490
Oh, old man.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.060
You don't look like a fool.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.970
You're a big ball.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.170
Well, since it's Jo-chan, I'm sure she doesn't have any bullets, though.

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.640
What an elegant guy.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.060
Well, I guess there's no one as elegant as him.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:39.220
Huh?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.500
That's Marukishi Kurouto.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.640
He suddenly used his flashy magic to kick us out of here and there,

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.000
and the boss was also made into a fireball and fell to the ground.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.440
If you notice, the treasure with the eyes is gone.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.140
Even we won't go that far.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:58.300
Evil people don't have human rights.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:04:59.820
What did you say?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.440
Right.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:04.440
It's supposed to be the head's revenge,

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.560
so it's the right thing to do to chase after him until he kills you.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.180
What on earth do you want to say?

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:12.300
How about it?

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.050
Do you have any intention of joining the Dragon's Teeth?

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:17.200
The Dragon's Teeth?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.600
I'm not joking.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:19.810
I can bend.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.960
If you're going to return the treasure and become our friend,

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.390
you can pour it all into the water.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:29.400
It's not a bad story.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.320
I'm not evil enough to be called a thief.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:34.780
I can't respond to your strong will.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.200
Who is an old man like you?

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:40.640
A man is only a prince on a boat.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:47.240
Get ready!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.910
That's a good line.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.130
Come out!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.640
This much? That's not a lot.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.260
W-What did you say?

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.740
It's not just this much!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.490
In the forest, one of our friends is my shadow voice!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.160
Your body is shaking!

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:18.470
If you want to apologize, all you have to do is save your life!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.280
Don't underestimate the dragon's fangs!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:36.190
That's all you have to do.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:36.990
That's all you have to do.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:37.590
You little thugs.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.390
You'd better run away with your husband and your tail.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:43.330
If you do that, I'll save your life.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.250
Shut up.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.630
You came out of nowhere.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.790
Who the hell are you?

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:50.610
I don't have a name to call you.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:51.250
What?

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:55.620
There's a guy named Namiko Matatsuki again.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:58.160
Shut up.

00:06:58.420 --> 00:06:59.040
I'll get rid of you.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.000
You three

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:34.710
Help me!

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.220
Not bad.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.370
Are you alright?

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:00.420
Ah!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:07.830
He's so obsessed with my beauty.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:08.810
There's no way I can do it.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.080
But I'm confident in my appearance.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.680
A lovely face.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.670
I want to protect a man without thinking about it.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.030
A pure and small body.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:23.300
It's like a simple sigh.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:24.720
I see.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.140
A child, huh?

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:29.410
In a situation like this...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.230
I thought she was a little better, but she's just a little kid in a dungulime.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:46.280
I'm a little shorter than girls of the same age, and my chest is a little flat, but I'm the one who cares about it the most.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:53.720
I tried to put on some powder and put on weight, but it's unfortunate that I have better ears than ordinary people.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:56.830
I'm sure he's whispering so that I can't hear him.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.220
I didn't come with you today.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:05.930
Oh, it's not that I was in danger, but I have to do that much.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.990
Even if it looks like this, I was raised by strict etiquette.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:17.480
No, it's not something to be thanked for again.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.830
More than that, are you not hurt, miss?

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:22.970
Miss?

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.330
It's dangerous for a girl to walk alone.

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.190
Is there no father or someone?

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:33.240
But...

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.360
He's a coward.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.750
Alright, I'll send you home.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:38.960
So, where are we going?

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.020
Well...

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:40.780
Over there?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:41.920
Wait a minute!

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.920
No, I'm traveling alone.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:48.220
I'm thinking of going to Atlas City for the time being.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.280
I can't believe it.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.340
Really?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.440
Yeah.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:53.990
Is that so?

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:57.270
You're having a hard time, too.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:58.030
What?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.240
No, I know. I know.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.900
There must have been a lot of things.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:05.480
No, I'm not...

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.360
You don't have to say anything. I know.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:13.170
You know, I just want to look around the world.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.300
I'll follow you to Atlas City.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.540
Hey, hey, hey.

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:19.660
I know.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.270
You need a friend.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:29.050
If I could go to Atlas City and hang out with my grumpy brother during the day...

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.540
I'm going to be so stressed until I get to Atlas City!

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:36.330
All right! Now that we're done talking, let's go!

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.060
We're done talking, but we still have this little thing to do.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:40.940
I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:46.110
I'm Gowrie. As you can see, I'm a traveler and a mercenary.

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:46.430
So?

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:51.510
Well, it doesn't look like you have any ulterior motives.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.620
Anyway, it looks like you're seriously worried about me.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:59.560
Come on, young lady.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.940
Let's go to the next village and have lunch with the kids.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.790
If we go out together, we might get stressed.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.680
Oh, I forgot to ask you.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.700
Miss, what's your name?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.120
I'll treat you, so you can order whatever you want.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.940
Really?!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:42.400
Then, I'll take all of them!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:43.960
All of them?!

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:46.340
This one, this one, this one, and this one.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:47.680
Three each!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.460
Three each?!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.170
There's still some soup left. Don't hold back.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.320
As expected, I can't take it anymore.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.650
I'm so full that I can't take it anymore.

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:48.210
Is that so?

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:50.470
From your stomach to your chest, you're completely...

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:50.830
You said something!

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:51.960
No, it's nothing.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.340
You're a traveller, aren't you?

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:54.540
Huh?

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:58.600
I'm sorry.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.900
My name is Saman, the elder of this town.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:08.890
Are you the famous genius witch Rina Inverse-sama?

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.180
Well...

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.120
What? You're a witch?

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.480
Hey, who are you?

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.610
You can tell by looking at this outfit, right?

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.670
I'm either a fish shop or a waitress.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:29.140
What the hell are you doing?

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:33.270
Um, is it okay if I continue my story?

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.510
At a time like this, the Dramata of that bandit killer,

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.970
I can't believe I'm meeting you, Ms. Rina Inverse!

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.950
You're famous, aren't you?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:49.110
Hey, I don't mind being a bandit killer, but what's a Dramata?

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.710
A dragon is also a demon!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.830
What did you say?!

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:54.950
I don't understand! Stop it!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:59.120
No, I didn't say it! It's just a rumor!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.830
What do you want from me?

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:06.540
Actually, this town has been targeted by the bandits for a while now.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.880
Are you talking about the dragon's fangs?

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.100
Oh, do you know that?

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:15.900
Oh, I've already crushed them.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.100
What did you say?

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:21.970
Yesterday, I beat them up, and the other day, this guy beat them up.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:26.820
Oh, you mean those guys from before?

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.940
Oh, that black dragon...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.300
I can't believe they're going to take down the Black Dragons after all this time!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.810
The Black Dragons that that band of bandits were fighting...

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:39.280
The city police force couldn't do anything about it.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.580
They had no choice but to follow their orders.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.820
As expected of Master Rina Inverse!

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:47.970
I wish I hadn't let them do it!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:53.260
Did you take down the dragons?

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.440
I don't know anything about that.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.380
Then, those dragons...

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.500
They won't grow up until now!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.240
What are you talking about?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.560
I don't know.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.880
What are you going to do?

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:05.430
It has nothing to do with it.

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.670
Do you want to chase a dragon that you don't even know where it is?

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:10.110
What?

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:11.210
It's the Black Dragon!

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:25.890
You didn't defeat the Black Dragon, did you?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.270
What's going on? What's going on?

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.060
I didn't defeat the dragon.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.240
You didn't say a word, did you?

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:34.000
I told you that I crushed the dragon's fangs.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.160
I-I can't believe it!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.870
You didn't defeat that dragon, and now you're saying you crushed it?

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:40.950
I don't know anything like that.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:42.830
I-I don't know anything like that.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:57.350
I said I'd push it for you.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:15:58.910
But it's for free.

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.150
How about 20 gold coins?

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:02.910
Hmm, 30.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.070
That's too expensive!

00:16:04.470 --> 00:16:06.670
You want to beat me before the town is built, don't you?

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:07.890
Hmm, 25!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.420
Well, that's fine.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:10.440
Hey, hey!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.930
I can't help it if you're desperate.

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.540
You're such a girl.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:42.630
When I was a child, I used to buy a lot of these when I was a child.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.670
Please give me three.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:46.440
What kind of Ennichi is this?

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.860
At first, it was as big as the size of my palm.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:54.380
But I took good care of it and raised it up to that point.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:58.360
Even if it's a dragon, it can understand love.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:16:59.520
What?

00:16:59.540 --> 00:16:59.960
Even if it's a dragon, it can understand love.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:12.900
Aikai-ka!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:32.580
Let it go!

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:40.780
Oh!

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:05.550
Those who are dark, those who are redder than the flow of blood, those who are blinded by the flow of time.

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:07.190
Hey, everyone! Remember this!

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:09.140
I swear to the darkness that I am the great Nanji.

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:15.420
I, Nanji, will stand in front of you and give equal destruction to all foolish people.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:22.640
Dragunov!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.860
Shut up and don't use it!

00:19:57.356 --> 00:19:59.356
If the result is good, everything is fine!

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:01.860
Is there anything I can do for you?

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:08.560
Hey, don't forget the money we promised!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.540
Don't mess with me!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.390
What are you going to do with that?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:23.130
As far as I'm concerned, Drag Slave is a great trick.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:24.460
That's too much!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.600
I knew it!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.050
Well, then...

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:28.580
That's it!

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:31.550
H-Hey!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:33.590
Grrr!

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:35.930
Hehehehe...

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:37.070
Don't run away!

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.660
It's your fault, Dramata!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:41.300
Uhe!

00:21:02.716 --> 00:21:03.156
Let's do this.

00:22:16.252 --> 00:22:16.752
Three!

00:22:20.988 --> 00:22:22.648
Miira Otoko wa shumi ja nai!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:23.440
Yoroshiku!
